  "description": "<p>The optimal everyday tee featuring the newest branch of the United States Military: Rothco&rsquo;s Space Force Athletic Fit T-Shirt. Rothco&rsquo;s Space Force t-shirt is designed with a slightly smaller chest, armholes and sleeve opening for an athletic fit and style. Our Space Force graphic tee is ideally comfortable for tough workouts, also doubling as a lounge wear essential. This military t-shirt features the United States Space Force logo and name largely printed across the chest, while the right sleeve of this US Space Force shirt features an American flag graphic in reverse orientation. Our Space Force short sleeve is made with a breathable but strong poly-cotton blend. This Space Force logo shirt includes a tag-less label, meaning zero irritation often caused by pesky paper tags.&nbsp;</p>",
